sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as IMAP client
    participant P as IMAP session
    participant R as registry "mailboxes"
    participant MB as mbox/ID (+ shards)
    participant F as ftsmap + ftx objects
    participant D as data pool msg/GUID/N
    C->>P: SELECT INBOX
    P->>R: look up m:INBOX (cached 2 s)
    P->>MB: read header: UIDNEXT, UIDVALIDITY, MODSEQ
    P-->>C: OK, EXISTS, UIDVALIDITY
    C->>P: FETCH 1:50 (FLAGS ENVELOPE)
    P->>MB: read entries m:UID (one omap read per page)
    P-->>C: flags and envelopes from the index
    C->>P: FETCH 7 BODY[]
    P->>D: read chunks of msg/GUID
    P-->>C: the message bytes
    C->>P: SEARCH BODY invoice
    P->>F: read layout record L, look up the word
    F-->>P: candidate documents
    P->>D: read each candidate to check it
    P-->>C: the matching UIDs
